      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The two stages",
      "prov:value": "Same shape as its exemption from the `visualiser` criterion in `check:subgraph-coverage`, and a **second criterion rather than a hole**: it owes its own `.json`/`.jsonld` instead (bean `hfkl`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
