      "cat-harness:section": "What stage 3 writes: `<harness>/state.jsonld`",
      "prov:value": "The owner named it *\"cat-harness/state.jsonld or so (whatever matches the dyanmic state vsualizesrs)\"*, which was an explicit uncertainty. **Settled 2026-10-29** (bean `6h47`, owner's option A): the workflow pages are the dynamic-state visualiser.",
