      "cat-harness:section": "This declares the order; `docs-site.yml` still publishes",
      "prov:value": "**A pipeline order that exists only as the sequence of steps in a YAML file is an order nobody can test** — bean `xom7` is what a workflow's behaviour costs when the repository holds no statement of it.",
